    "name": "3D Escape Room: Mystic Manor",
    "steam_appid": 3612480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>3D Escape Room: Mystic Manor</i></strong>! This is a 3D realistic puzzle escape game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you inherit your grandfather's legacy - a manor. While exploring this manor, you discover unspeakable secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, you open door after door in the ancient mansion, follow clues, solve magnificent puzzles and mechanisms, and attempt to uncover the truth buried beneath this ancient manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 16 uniquely styled rooms, over 12 hours of gameplay, hundreds of puzzles and mini-games covering logical reasoning, mathematical calculations, item combinations, and more... Various types of puzzles are perfectly integrated with the story. Use your keen observation and powerful logical reasoning to solve these exciting puzzles and sharpen your wisdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magical X-Ray Eyepiece</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game, you will unlock another visual dimension! Manipulate internal mechanical structures by seeing through object surfaces and discover mysterious clues invisible to the naked eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breathtaking Graphics &amp; 3D Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rooms in the game authentically recreate specific historical eras and local cultural elements from the story's setting. We've combined these beautiful visual elements with puzzle challenges, allowing you to enjoy exploring these exquisite scenes while solving puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong><i>3D Escape Room: Mystic Manor</i></strong>! This is a 3D realistic puzzle escape game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you inherit your grandfather's legacy - a manor. While exploring this manor, you discover unspeakable secrets hidden within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven by curiosity, you open door after door in the ancient mansion, follow clues, solve magnificent puzzles and mechanisms, and attempt to uncover the truth buried beneath this ancient manor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/c67019cd7d568241ae92835d5d656589.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes 16 uniquely styled rooms, over 12 hours of gameplay, hundreds of puzzles and mini-games covering logical reasoning, mathematical calculations, item combinations, and more... Various types of puzzles are perfectly integrated with the story. Use your keen observation and powerful logical reasoning to solve these exciting puzzles and sharpen your wisdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/729f17a84384843f5979184eb84b1065.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Magical X-Ray Eyepiece</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In our game, you will unlock another visual dimension! Manipulate internal mechanical structures by seeing through object surfaces and discover mysterious clues invisible to the naked eye!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/48d3ddf77146c8cb7007d8678638a9a5.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breathtaking Graphics &amp; 3D Visuals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rooms in the game authentically recreate specific historical eras and local cultural elements from the story's setting. We've combined these beautiful visual elements with puzzle challenges, allowing you to enjoy exploring these exquisite scenes while solving puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.poster.avif?t=1753365219\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.webm?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612480/extras/6744ca7ee9b6bace109656dba1c5f793.mp4?t=1753365219\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Every corner of this manor holds secrets. You inherit not just the estate, but scattered letters and an intricately designed puzzle. Eyepieces transcending spacetime plunge you into others' memories. Traverse 16 themed chambers, unravel nested mechanisms, until you unveil the buried past...",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese",
    "reviews": "\u201cThis new release stands as a rare dark horse in the realm of 3D puzzle games. Featuring mechanism boxes of hair-raising intricacy, thematically distinct rooms with razor-sharp identity, and challenge-redefining innovative puzzles - it undeniably emerges as a time-devouring, meticulously crafted masterpiece.\u201d<br>\u6c5f\u5b63<br><br>\u201cGorgeous graphics, clever puzzles and creative mechanism design. Surpassed all my expectations.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Scurvymay<br><br>\u201cThat is what i expect from this sort of game, original and difficult puzzles that make you use your brain.\u201d<br>5/5 \u2013 Leigh Brooks<br>",
